    "authorityType": "project-owner instruction",
    "instructionVerbatim": "I explicitly approve the governed Build 27 campaign using application and backend source baseline commit `2ab554d143bd778cfa1b4d9ab2ed3c35cf62b056`.\nI approve deploying the existing 15-function fleet to production project `crm3-baf-ops-b8638`, region `asia-south1`, using the existing dedicated service accounts, `PreserveExistingIam`, and App Check enforcement remaining false. The scheduled function may be deployed but must not be manually invoked.\nI approve strict live readback of the unchanged Firestore Rules SHA-256 `823877B9B03F8D4E2687532615F5037A9742F3AA224AE209BC2C7A866F845E04` and unchanged 66-index set SHA-256 `E58BEAEF69212C4B00035C120F345D25F962588EE84ACC6D88363CD5EE2D95A4`; neither rules nor indexes are to be redeployed.\nAfter successful readback, I approve creating, pushing, reviewing and merging the necessary backend-reconciliation and Build 27 governance changes, provided review and CI are clean. I approve allocating and constructing production-signed Build 27 (`1.0.0-rc.17+27`) from the exact resulting `main` commit, followed by independent package verification, dual custody, copying the verified APK to Downloads, and installing it on the attached phone as an in-place upgrade preserving all app data.\nNo IAM change, App Check activation, production business-data mutation or deletion, scheduler invocation, device-data clearing, wider distribution, Play Store publication, or unrestricted publication is authorized.",
    "instructionSummary": "Deploy and strictly read back the exact Build 27 backend without invoking the scheduler or redeploying rules/indexes, then prepare, construct, verify, retain and install one protected Build 27 after clean review and CI.",
    "timestampSource": "Codex task history user message timestamp",
    "scopeInterpretation": "The instruction authorizes the exact backend campaign, governance reconciliation, one protected Build 27 construction, independent verification, dual custody, copying the verified APK to Downloads and one attached-phone in-place installation preserving app data. It does not authorize IAM mutation, App Check activation, business-data mutation or deletion, manual scheduler invocation, device-data clearing, wider distribution or publication."
  },
  "approvalReference": "BAF-REF-003-C26",
  "authorityBasis": "The project owner explicitly approved the exact Build 27 source baseline, IAM-preserving backend deployment, invocation-free scheduler handling, strict live readback, governance reconciliation, one protected Build 27 construction and one verified in-place attached-phone installation. Artifact-affecting paths remain content-exact to the admitted PR 355 baseline, while the protected workflow must admit and record the exact resulting main commit after this governance PR merges and passes exact-main CI.",
  "approvalScope": "Allocate unused Build 27, version 1.0.0-rc.17, for one governed production-signed successor of finalized Build 26. Include the admitted workflow ownership and evidence clarity, inspection governance, audit deletion guard, legacy evidence preservation, timestamp compatibility and release inventory corrections in PR 355. Independent package verification, dual custody, copying the verified APK to Downloads and one attached-phone in-place upgrade preserving app data are authorized. Business-data mutation, IAM changes, App Check activation, manual scheduler invocation and wider distribution remain prohibited.",
